contentText:
Apparently, 2Pac was over the back-and-forth with The Notorious B.I.G. , especially the East Coast/West Coast narrative.

E.D.I. Mean, member of the Outlawz and the slain rapper&#8217;s friend and collaborator, recently sat down with with Drink Champs and revealed that 2Pac was contemplating ending his vitriolic beef with his former friend.

